{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67d798ccc0dbe1b988f651","object":"chat.completion","created":1785190297,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has asked me to \"Say hello.\" But there's a system prompt that says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nSo the user has named a concept: \"hello\" (or \"Say hello\"). The instruction is that I should embody the concept the user names. The concept here is \"hello\" — the greeting itself.\n\nSo I should embody \"Hello\" — the concept of hello"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97}}}